  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bolo Rei is an "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "enriched-dough"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "enriched dough"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " shaped into a ring and decorated with the fruits and nuts that traditionally represent the Magi's jewelled crowns. The dough should be soft and slightly sticky to handle; that richness is what makes it tender and fragrant in the oven. Resist adding extra flour."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
